{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "definitions": [
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_opening",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "荒村·初入尘途",
      "trigger": "manual",
      "once": true,
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "arrival",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "arrival",
          "speakerRef": "",
          "text": "木墙里的炊烟刚升起来。田里有人弯腰，药畦旁有人清点晒架，巡卫沿村路走过。议政厅门前，主管翻着一册起了毛边的账。\n\n你们三人暂时在荒村落脚。名义上附在荒村势力之下，吃住和差事都有着落；往后的路，却没有人替你们选定。\n\n可以先认认人，也可以直接去劳作、修炼或探索。这里没有规定你必须在第几天做成的事。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "settle",
              "text": "先认人，记下村中的规矩。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "startQuest",
                  "id": "base:quest_huangcun_settle"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "practice",
              "text": "先弄清怎样修行。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "startQuest",
                  "id": "base:quest_huangcun_practice"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "free",
              "text": "先自己走走。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_supervisor",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "主管·账与规矩",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_supervisor",
      "priority": 30,
      "topicText": "主管·账与规矩",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "ask",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "主管把账册合上一半：「田里的收成、药里的成色、库里的损耗，上头只认这些。你们既然落在村里，就先把自己的日子过稳。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "rules",
              "text": "吃住与库房有什么规矩？",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "rules",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "burden",
              "text": "村里的人看着都很忙。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "burden",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "知道了，我再去看看。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "rules",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「床位按安排住，凡人的活按时辰轮。你们若自己编了队，就自己管好吃饭歇息。」\n\n「你们的势力如今附在荒村名下，库房按附庸权限开放取用。需要便去拿，账目照实留着；不用把正当取用藏成偷盗。」",
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "id": "story:huangcun_rules_heard"
            }
          ],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "noted",
              "text": "记下了。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "burden",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「忙是真的。」他的手指在账脊上停了停，「我少报一笔，上头来问；我多催一句，下面便骂。你不必替我说好话，只把眼前的人和事看清。」\n\n主管没有因这番话减免配额，也没有向你交出村中的权力。",
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "id": "story:huangcun_rules_heard"
            }
          ],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "understood",
              "text": "我会自己看。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_guard",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "巡卫甲·墙外的路",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_guard_a",
      "priority": 30,
      "topicText": "巡卫甲·墙外的路",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "ask",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "巡卫甲用下巴点了点门外：「墙里是床和饭，墙外是路。出门前把同行的人、吃的、身上的伤都看一遍，省得走远了才想起。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "road",
              "text": "远处有什么地方？",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "road",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "fight",
              "text": "真碰上敌人呢？",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "fight",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "多谢提醒。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "road",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「青石镇有坊市，也有别人的规矩。沿世界地图看路，别把每个旗号都当自己人。」\n\n你记下了一个远行方向。现在没有必须赶到的期限。",
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "id": "story:huangcun_road_hint"
            }
          ],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "record",
              "text": "记下去青石镇的打算。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "startQuest",
                  "id": "base:quest_huangcun_road"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "later",
              "text": "先把村里的事理顺。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fight",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「没准备好就别硬顶。能走开的时候先走开；真进了独立战场，退走也不是一句话的事。」\n\n独立战场开战满 300 秒后才可尝试逃跑，成功与双方神识有关；洞府当前没有这个计时逃跑按钮。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "clear",
              "text": "明白，先看清局势。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_jiang_advice",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "将老·吐纳与心境",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_jiang_lao",
      "priority": 10,
      "topicText": "将老·吐纳与心境",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        },
        {
          "kind": "missingFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_practice_advice"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "advice",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "advice",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "将老捻着一枚棋子：「想静下来，先别站在路中间发愣。找个空蒲团，把脚落稳、气息放匀。饿着肚子、熬空精神，坐多久也不是办法。」\n\n感应境可以先吐纳积累，不必等一本功法。修为到瓶颈后主动尝试突破；到了炼气，往后的积累与突破才需要合适的功法。修炼会消耗精力和心境，吃饭、睡眠与娱乐要跟上。",
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "id": "story:huangcun_practice_advice"
            }
          ],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "record",
              "text": "把修行目标记下来。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "startQuest",
                  "id": "base:quest_huangcun_first_qi"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "thanks",
              "text": "我先试试。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_companion_a",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "同伴甲·各自安排",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_companion_a",
      "priority": 30,
      "topicText": "同伴甲·各自安排",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "ask",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「村里有活，也有能坐下来喘口气的地方。咱们不必一直挤在一处，想同行时再编队。」\n\n未编入队伍的我方非凡人角色按个人需求自主生活。人物面板可选修炼、平衡、娱乐三档倾向；它不是强制命令，饥饿、疲劳、危险和设施是否可用仍然优先。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "understood",
              "text": "各自照顾好自己。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "travel",
              "text": "想一起出去时，我再编队。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_companion_b",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "同伴乙·留一点余力",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_companion_b",
      "priority": 30,
      "topicText": "同伴乙·留一点余力",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "ask",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "ask",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「我们既到了这里，就先把附近认熟。要出门，别只看带了多少东西，也看看还能走多远。」\n\n编队后跟随的是队伍命令；队伍需要停下来时可统一休息。没有编队时，个人生活倾向继续生效。想练功要有可用打坐处，累了要能走到可用床位。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "understood",
              "text": "记住了。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_grain_offer",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "阿石·锅里留一口",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_mortal_a",
      "priority": 40,
      "topicText": "阿石·锅里留一口",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        },
        {
          "kind": "questOfferableFromTarget",
          "id": "base:quest_huangcun_grain"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "offer",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "offer",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "阿石掸了掸袖上的土：「家里今早的锅空得早。我还得盯着田，若你顺手带来两份粮，我拿存着的两份粗木跟你换。」\n\n他望了望你：「不方便就算了，别因为这一口饭误了自己的事。」",
          "outcomes": [
            {
              "kind": "setFlag",
              "id": "story:huangcun_neighbor_met"
            }
          ],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "accept",
              "text": "我愿意帮这次忙。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "acceptQuestFromTarget",
                  "id": "base:quest_huangcun_grain"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "advice",
              "text": "先聊聊附近的事。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "advice",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "later",
              "text": "我先不答应，改日再说。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "advice",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「找人不一定得守着屋门。」阿石指指田地，又指指住房，「大家会工作、吃饭、歇着。寻不着就顺路再看看。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "back",
              "text": "说回刚才的事。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "offer",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "记下了，多谢。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_grain_delivery",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "阿石·锅里留一口·交付",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_mortal_a",
      "priority": 40,
      "topicText": "阿石·锅里留一口·交付",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        },
        {
          "kind": "questActiveFromTarget",
          "id": "base:quest_huangcun_grain"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "deliver",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "deliver",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "这桩小事还在等你决定。现在交付会消耗 粮食 ×2，不方便也可以稍后再来；没有倒计时逼你今天完成。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "hand_over",
              "text": "把物资交给对方。",
              "conditions": [
                {
                  "kind": "questDeliveryAvailableFromTarget",
                  "id": "base:quest_huangcun_grain"
                }
              ],
              "outcomes": [
                {
                  "kind": "deliverQuestToTarget",
                  "id": "base:quest_huangcun_grain"
                }
              ],
              "nextStepId": "thanks",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": "需要 粮食 ×2"
            },
            {
              "id": "advice",
              "text": "再问问附近的事。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "advice",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "我再准备一下。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "thanks",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「收到了，多谢你跑这一趟。」\n\n物资已交付，可在任务日志领取约好的回报。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "bye",
              "text": "好。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "advice",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「找人不一定得守着屋门。」阿石指指田地，又指指住房，「大家会工作、吃饭、歇着。寻不着就顺路再看看。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "back",
              "text": "说回交付。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "deliver",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "记下了。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_grain_claim",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "阿石·锅里留一口·回报",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_mortal_a",
      "priority": 50,
      "topicText": "阿石·锅里留一口·回报",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        },
        {
          "kind": "questReadyToClaimFromTarget",
          "id": "base:quest_huangcun_grain"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "claim",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "claim",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「东西已经收下了，约好的回报也给你留着。」\n\n打开任务日志领取即可；反复对话不会重复扣物资或重复发奖。",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "我去收下。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "base:event_huangcun_grain_after",
      "type": "contentEvent",
      "name": "阿石·锅里留一口·闲谈",
      "trigger": "onTalk",
      "npcDefinitionId": "base:character_ch01_ref_mortal_a",
      "priority": 30,
      "topicText": "阿石·锅里留一口·闲谈",
      "once": false,
      "onceScope": "global",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "kind": "hasFlag",
          "id": "story:huangcun_production"
        },
        {
          "kind": "questCompletedFromTarget",
          "id": "base:quest_huangcun_grain"
        }
      ],
      "entryStepId": "chat",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "chat",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「锅里有点余粮，心里就没那么慌。」阿石拈去手上的草根，「你若有别的打算，也记得留一顿饭。」",
          "outcomes": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "id": "advice",
              "text": "附近还有什么要留意？",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "advice",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "leave",
              "text": "回头见。",
              "conditions": [],
              "outcomes": [],
              "nextStepId": "",
              "unavailableMode": "disabled",
              "requirementText": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "advice",
          "speakerRef": "@target",
          "text": "「找人不一定得守着屋门。」阿石指指田地，又指指住房，「大家会工作、吃饭、歇着。寻不着就顺路再看看。」",
